  "detail_text": "The U.S. Army Corps of Engineers (USACE), Baltimore District, is conducting market research for a potential future requirement for technical support services. This Sources Sought notice seeks to identify qualified firms capable of providing: Area A: Construction Management Support (CMS) Area B: Scheduling, Project Controls, and Delay/Claims Analysis The Government will use responses to this notice to inform its acquisition strategy. This is not a solicitation. Responses are required via a survey link contained within the full announcement details and/or attachments. Interested parties must review all documents for the complete requirement description and submission instructions.",
